{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"11d4bf577d87d87c","__entryId":"style-editorial","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;background:#faf7f1;border:1px solid #e8e2d4;padding:18px 26px;color:#26221b\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#8a7f6a\"><span>岭南建筑志</span><span>城市特刊 · 春</span></div>\n      <div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:6px;color:#1c1812;margin:10px 0 8px\">光落进建筑的方式</div>\n      <div style=\"border-top:3px double #b8ac93;padding-top:12px\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/style-imagery/editorial-architecture.webp\" style=\"width:100%;height:120px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a7f6a;font-style:italic;margin-top:5px\">图：西九龙文化区，午后。摄影 / Cai Fang</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"column-count:2;column-gap:20px;column-rule:1px solid #e8e2d4;font-size:12px;line-height:1.85;text-align:justify;color:#3d372c;margin-top:12px\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0\"><span class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:700;float:left;line-height:.9;padding:3px 6px 0 0;color:#1c1812\">建</span>筑师把窗称作「缓慢的时钟」。晨光从墙脚移动到桌面，房间便拥有了不需要提醒的时间。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0\">石、木与玻璃没有争夺视线。它们只是把天气留在室内，也让居住者重新注意一天的变化。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#8a7f6a;margin-top:12px\">— 018 —</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;background:#fdfcf9;border:1px solid #e8e2d4;padding:22px 30px;color:#26221b\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#8a7f6a\">专栏 · 慢观察 · 第 47 期</div>\n      <div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#1c1812;margin-top:8px\">我们为什么不再读完一本书</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a7f6a;margin-top:6px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e2d4\">文 / 林之　·　阅读约 12 分钟</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#3d372c;margin-top:12px\">注意力是最稀缺的资源，这句话你已经听过一万遍。但真正的问题不是注意力变短了，而是我们把「读完」的成就感，让渡给了「划过」的快感。</div>\n      <div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:700;color:#1c1812;text-align:center;margin:18px 40px;line-height:1.5\">「深读不是怀旧，<br>而是一种抵抗。」</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#3d372c\">那些需要二十页铺垫才抵达的段落，恰是短视频永远无法压缩的部分——思想有自己的时长，拒绝倍速。<sup style=\"color:#a8552f\">[1]</sup></div>\n      <div style=\"border-top:1px solid #e8e2d4;margin-top:14px;padding-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:#8a7f6a\">[1] 《慢读宣言》，2024，未名出版</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;background:#faf7f1;border:1px solid #e8e2d4;color:#26221b\">\n      <div style=\"position:relative\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/style-imagery/editorial-travel-forest.webp\" style=\"width:100%;height:150px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;padding:14px 26px;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(20,16,10,.65))\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8)\">目的地特辑 · 莫干山</div>\n          <div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:#fff\">去山里，住一周</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:16px 26px 18px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#3d372c\">不打卡、不赶路。这份行程单只有三件事：散步、喝茶、看云。</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e8e2d4;padding-top:12px\">\n          <div style=\"flex:1\"><div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1c1812\">壹 · 抵达</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3d372c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.7\">庾村民宿落脚，晚饭吃笋</div></div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1\"><div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1c1812\">贰 · 山里</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3d372c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.7\">剑池步道，竹林里走半天</div></div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1\"><div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1c1812\">叁 · 慢下来</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3d372c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.7\">白云书馆，发呆到日落</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#f3ead9;border:1px solid #e0d4bc;padding:20px 26px;color:#26221b;position:relative;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#8a7f6a\"><span>VOL.12</span><span>2026 春季号 · ¥25</span></div>\n      <div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:44px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:14px;color:#1c1812;margin:14px 0 4px\">慢 城 志</div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#8a7f6a\">SLOW CITY JOURNAL</div>\n      <img src=\"/assets/style-imagery/editorial-light-study.webp\" style=\"width:100%;height:110px;object-fit:cover;display:block;margin:14px 0\" alt=\"\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;font-size:12px;line-height:2;color:#3d372c\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1\"><b class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#1c1812\">封面故事</b><br>缓慢生活的复兴<br>老街豆浆铺的清晨</div>\n        <div style=\"flex:1\"><b class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#1c1812\">本期还有</b><br>七位回城青年的选择<br>手冲咖啡与工夫茶</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;margin-top:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#8a7f6a\">— 042 —</span><span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#8a7f6a\">▌▍▌▌▍▌▍▍ 6-2026-12</span></div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div style=\"max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;background:#faf7f1;border:1px solid #e8e2d4;padding:18px 26px;color:#26221b\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#8a7f6a\"><span>Lingnan Architecture Chronicle</span><span>City Special Issue · Spring</span></div>\n      <div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:6px;color:#1c1812;margin:10px 0 8px\">The way light falls into the building</div>\n      <div style=\"border-top:3px double #b8ac93;padding-top:12px\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/style-imagery/editorial-architecture.webp\" style=\"width:100%;height:120px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a7f6a;font-style:italic;margin-top:5px\">Picture: West Kowloon Cultural District, afternoon. Photography / Cai Fang</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"column-count:2;column-gap:20px;column-rule:1px solid #e8e2d4;font-size:12px;line-height:1.85;text-align:justify;color:#3d372c;margin-top:12px\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0\"><span class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:700;float:left;line-height:.9;padding:3px 6px 0 0;color:#1c1812\">Architecture</span> Architects call windows \"slow clocks.\" The morning light moves from the wall to the table, and the room has a time that does not require reminders. </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0\">Stone, wood and glass do not compete for sight. They simply keep the weather indoors and allow the occupants to refocus on the changes of the day. </p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#8a7f6a;margin-top:12px\">— 018 —</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;background:#fdfcf9;border:1px solid #e8e2d4;padding:22px 30px;color:#26221b\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#8a7f6a\">Column · Slow Observation · Issue 47</div>\n      <div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#1c1812;margin-top:8px\">Why don’t we finish reading a book again</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a7f6a;margin-top:6px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e2d4\">Text/Lin Zhi·Read about 12 minutes</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#3d372c;margin-top:12px\">Attention is the scarcest resource, you have heard this sentence 10,000 times. But the real problem is not that our attention span has become shorter, but that we have given up the sense of accomplishment of \"reading\" to the pleasure of \"swiping through\". </div>\n      <div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:700;color:#1c1812;text-align:center;margin:18px 40px;line-height:1.5\">\"Deep reading is not nostalgia,<br>but a kind of resistance.\"</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#3d372c\">Those paragraphs that require twenty pages of foreshadowing are exactly the part that short videos can never be compressed - thoughts have their own duration and refuse to be doubled. <sup style=\"color:#a8552f\">[1]</sup></div>\n      <div style=\"border-top:1px solid #e8e2d4;margin-top:14px;padding-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:#8a7f6a\">[1] \"Slow Reading Manifesto\", 2024, Weiming Publishing</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;background:#faf7f1;border:1px solid #e8e2d4;color:#26221b\">\n      <div style=\"position:relative\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/style-imagery/editorial-travel-forest.webp\" style=\"width:100%;height:150px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;padding:14px 26px;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(20,16,10,.65))\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8)\">Destination Special · Mogan Mountain</div>\n          <div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:#fff\">Go to the mountains and live for a week</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:16px 26px 18px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#3d372c\">Flexible hoursing in or rushing. There are only three things on this itinerary: walking, drinking tea, and watching the clouds. </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e8e2d4;padding-top:12px\">\n          <div style=\"flex:1\"><div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1c1812\">One · Arrival</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3d372c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.7\">Settled in Yucun B&B and had bamboo shoots for dinner</div></div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1\"><div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1c1812\">Two · In the Mountains</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3d372c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.7\">Jianchi Trail, a half-day walk in the bamboo forest</div></div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1\"><div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1c1812\">Three · Slow Down</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3d372c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.7\">Baiyun Library, in a daze until sunset</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#f3ead9;border:1px solid #e0d4bc;padding:20px 26px;color:#26221b;position:relative;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#8a7f6a\"><span>VOL.12</span><span>2026 Spring Issue · ¥25</span></div>\n      <div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:44px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:14px;color:#1c1812;margin:14px 0 4px\">Slow City Chronicle</div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#8a7f6a\">SLOW CITY JOURNAL</div>\n      <img src=\"/assets/style-imagery/editorial-light-study.webp\" style=\"width:100%;height:110px;object-fit:cover;display:block;margin:14px 0\" alt=\"\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;font-size:12px;line-height:2;color:#3d372c\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1\"><b class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#1c1812\">Cover story</b><br>The resurgence of slow life<br>Early morning at the old street soy milk shop</div>\n        <div style=\"flex:1\"><b class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#1c1812\">There are also choices in this issue</b><br>Seven young people who have returned to the city<br>Hand-brew coffee and Gongfu tea</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;margin-top:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#8a7f6a\">— 042 —</span><span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#8a7f6a\">▌▍▌▌▍▌▍▍ 6-2026-12</span></div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span style=\"display:inline-flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"serif\"><span class=\"style-editorial-chip\"><b class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:14px;color:#1c1812\">衬 Aa</b>衬线标题</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"sans\"><span class=\"style-editorial-chip\"><b style=\"font-size:13px;color:#3d372c\">无 Aa</b>无衬线正文</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"cols\"><span class=\"style-editorial-chip\"><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d9d2c4 40%,#fff 40%,#fff 60%,#d9d2c4 60%)\"></i>分栏</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"dropcap\"><span class=\"style-editorial-chip\"><b class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:#1c1812;line-height:1;border:1px solid #d9d2c4;padding:1px 3px\">首</b>首字下沉</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"masthead\"><span class=\"style-editorial-chip\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#8a7f6a\">VOL.12 · P.042</span>刊头页码</span></span>\n    </span>","demo_en":"<span style=\"display:inline-flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"serif\"><span class=\"style-editorial-chip\"><b class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:14px;color:#1c1812\">Serif Aa</b> serif title</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"sans\"><span class=\"style-editorial-chip\"><b style=\"font-size:13px;color:#3d372c\">None Aa</b> Sans serif text</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"cols\"><span class=\"style-editorial-chip\"><i style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#d9d2c4 40%,#fff 40%,#fff 60%,#d9d2c4 60%)\"></i>Column</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"dropcap\"><span class=\"style-editorial-chip\"><b class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:16px;color:#1c1812;line-height:1;border:1px solid #d9d2c4;padding:1px 3px\">First</b> Drop Cap</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"masthead\"><span class=\"style-editorial-chip\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#8a7f6a\">VOL.12 · P.042</span>Masthead page number</span></span>\n    </span>","parts":[{"key":"serif","cn":"衬线标题","en":"Serif","desc":"Georgia / 宋体一族，负责气质和分量","desc_en":"Use a serif display face, such as Georgia or an appropriate CJK serif, to add editorial character and visual weight."},{"key":"sans","cn":"无衬线正文","en":"Sans","desc":"正文用无衬线保持易读，两族字体搭出层次","desc_en":"The text is sans-serif to keep it easy to read, and two types of fonts create hierarchy."},{"key":"cols","cn":"分栏","en":"Columns","desc":"栏窄行短，长文读感的关键，小屏记得收回单栏","desc_en":"Narrow columns and short lines are the key to reading long articles. Remember to collapse to one column on small screens."},{"key":"dropcap","cn":"首字处理","en":"Drop Cap","desc":"可在合适的长文开篇使用，为段落建立入口；不适合每段或所有语言","desc_en":"Use at the start of a suitable long article to introduce a paragraph. It does not suit every paragraph or language."},{"key":"masthead","cn":"刊头页码","en":"Masthead","desc":"用期号、页码和栏题建立杂志式编辑语境","desc_en":"Create magazine-style editorial context with issue numbers, page numbers and column titles"}]},"use":[{"t":"品牌故事和关于页面，需要人物与图片叙事","m":"style-editorial-use-story"},{"t":"深度文章和专栏，需要组织多层图文内容","m":"style-editorial-use-long"},{"t":"文旅与生活方式页面，重视阅读氛围","m":"style-editorial-use-travel"},{"t":"年报和专题页面，需要出版物式节奏","m":"style-editorial-use-annual"}],"dont":[{"t":"工具后台让装饰排版阻碍高频操作","m":"style-editorial-dont-tool","bad":true},{"t":"客服和工单等任务页面牺牲扫描效率","m":"style-editorial-dont-ops","bad":true},{"t":"转化页面让主要行动被分栏和图片淹没","m":"style-editorial-dont-cta","bad":true},{"t":"小屏继续保留多栏，导致每栏过窄","m":"style-editorial-dont-mobile","bad":true}],"principles":[{"t":"<b>衬线标题 + 无衬线正文</b>：两族字体各司其职，层次和气质一起出来","m":"style-editorial-pair"},{"t":"<b>分栏排版控制行长</b>：宽屏可以多栏，小屏应回到单栏并保持自然阅读顺序","m":"style-editorial-cols"},{"t":"<b>选择少量出版物信号</b>：首字下沉、刊头、期号和页码按内容需要使用，不必全部堆上","m":"style-editorial-signal"},{"t":"<b>行距与留白服务长文</b>：具体数值按字体、语言和字号测试，不以 1.8 为固定起点","m":"style-editorial-pace"},{"t":"<b>图片与图注共同表达信息</b>：大图可配简短图注，说明内容、地点或来源","m":"style-editorial-photo"}],"prompt":"做一篇城市观察长文页。用标题、导语、正文、图片和图注建立像杂志一样的阅读节奏；分栏、衬线标题或首字处理只在帮助阅读时使用，并保证手机上也能顺畅阅读。","prompt_en":"Editorial magazine page, large serif headline with sans-serif body, responsive columns, drop cap, masthead and issue details, warm paper background, large photography with precise captions","references":[{"title":"CSS 多列布局","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_multicol_layout","title_en":"CSS Multi-column Layout"},{"title":"::first-letter 伪元素","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/::first-letter","title_en":"::first-letter"}],"scenes":["杂志风品牌故事页","深度专栏长文","文旅目的地特辑","数字杂志封面"],"en":{"prompt":"Editorial magazine page, large serif headline with sans-serif body, responsive columns, drop cap, masthead and issue details, warm paper background, large photography with precise captions","use":[{"t":"Magazine and culture site","m":"style-editorial-use-story"},{"t":"Brand story","m":"style-editorial-use-long"},{"t":"Long-form case study","m":"style-editorial-use-travel"},{"t":"Travel, fashion, or architecture feature","m":"style-editorial-use-annual"}],"dont":[{"t":"Use dramatic layouts around thin content","m":"style-editorial-dont-tool","bad":true},{"t":"Make body text secondary to decoration","m":"style-editorial-dont-ops","bad":true},{"t":"Copy a print spread without responsive behavior","m":"style-editorial-dont-cta","bad":true},{"t":"Mix typefaces with no assigned editorial roles","m":"style-editorial-dont-mobile","bad":true}],"principles":[{"t":"Let the story determine the visual rhythm","m":"style-editorial-pair"},{"t":"Pair expressive headlines with readable body text","m":"style-editorial-cols"},{"t":"Use images, captions, and pull quotes as real editorial material","m":"style-editorial-signal"},{"t":"Control line length and whitespace for long reading","m":"style-editorial-pace"},{"t":"Recompose the hierarchy for each screen size","m":"style-editorial-photo"}],"scenes":["Magazine feature","Brand story","Case study","Travel article"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;background:#faf7f1;border:1px solid #e8e2d4;padding:18px 26px;color:#26221b\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#8a7f6a\"><span>Lingnan Architecture Chronicle</span><span>City Special Issue · Spring</span></div>\n      <div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:6px;color:#1c1812;margin:10px 0 8px\">The way light falls into the building</div>\n      <div style=\"border-top:3px double #b8ac93;padding-top:12px\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/style-imagery/editorial-architecture.webp\" style=\"width:100%;height:120px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a7f6a;font-style:italic;margin-top:5px\">Picture: West Kowloon Cultural District, afternoon. Photography / Cai Fang</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"column-count:2;column-gap:20px;column-rule:1px solid #e8e2d4;font-size:12px;line-height:1.85;text-align:justify;color:#3d372c;margin-top:12px\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0\"><span class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:700;float:left;line-height:.9;padding:3px 6px 0 0;color:#1c1812\">Architecture</span> Architects call windows \"slow clocks.\" The morning light moves from the wall to the table, and the room has a time that does not require reminders. </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0\">Stone, wood and glass do not compete for sight. They simply keep the weather indoors and allow the occupants to refocus on the changes of the day. </p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#8a7f6a;margin-top:12px\">— 018 —</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;background:#fdfcf9;border:1px solid #e8e2d4;padding:22px 30px;color:#26221b\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#8a7f6a\">Column · Slow Observation · Issue 47</div>\n      <div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#1c1812;margin-top:8px\">Why don’t we finish reading a book again</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a7f6a;margin-top:6px;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #e8e2d4\">Text/Lin Zhi·Read about 12 minutes</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#3d372c;margin-top:12px\">Attention is the scarcest resource, you have heard this sentence 10,000 times. But the real problem is not that our attention span has become shorter, but that we have given up the sense of accomplishment of \"reading\" to the pleasure of \"swiping through\". </div>\n      <div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:700;color:#1c1812;text-align:center;margin:18px 40px;line-height:1.5\">\"Deep reading is not nostalgia,<br>but a kind of resistance.\"</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#3d372c\">Those paragraphs that require twenty pages of foreshadowing are exactly the part that short videos can never be compressed - thoughts have their own duration and refuse to be doubled. <sup style=\"color:#a8552f\">[1]</sup></div>\n      <div style=\"border-top:1px solid #e8e2d4;margin-top:14px;padding-top:8px;font-size:12px;color:#8a7f6a\">[1] \"Slow Reading Manifesto\", 2024, Weiming Publishing</div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;background:#faf7f1;border:1px solid #e8e2d4;color:#26221b\">\n      <div style=\"position:relative\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/style-imagery/editorial-travel-forest.webp\" style=\"width:100%;height:150px;object-fit:cover;display:block\" alt=\"\">\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;padding:14px 26px;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(20,16,10,.65))\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8)\">Destination Special · Mogan Mountain</div>\n          <div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:#fff\">Go to the mountains and live for a week</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding:16px 26px 18px\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#3d372c\">Flexible hoursing in or rushing. There are only three things on this itinerary: walking, drinking tea, and watching the clouds. </div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e8e2d4;padding-top:12px\">\n          <div style=\"flex:1\"><div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1c1812\">One · Arrival</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3d372c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.7\">Settled in Yucun B&B and had bamboo shoots for dinner</div></div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1\"><div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1c1812\">Two · In the Mountains</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3d372c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.7\">Jianchi Trail, a half-day walk in the bamboo forest</div></div>\n          <div style=\"flex:1\"><div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1c1812\">Three · Slow Down</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#3d372c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.7\">Baiyun Library, in a daze until sunset</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;background:#f3ead9;border:1px solid #e0d4bc;padding:20px 26px;color:#26221b;position:relative;overflow:hidden\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#8a7f6a\"><span>VOL.12</span><span>2026 Spring Issue · ¥25</span></div>\n      <div class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:44px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:14px;color:#1c1812;margin:14px 0 4px\">Slow City Chronicle</div>\n      <div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#8a7f6a\">SLOW CITY JOURNAL</div>\n      <img src=\"/assets/style-imagery/editorial-light-study.webp\" style=\"width:100%;height:110px;object-fit:cover;display:block;margin:14px 0\" alt=\"\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:20px;font-size:12px;line-height:2;color:#3d372c\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1\"><b class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#1c1812\">Cover story</b><br>The resurgence of slow life<br>Early morning at the old street soy milk shop</div>\n        <div style=\"flex:1\"><b class=\"style-editorial-sc-serif\" style=\"font-size:13px;color:#1c1812\">There are also choices in this issue</b><br>Seven young people who have returned to the city<br>Hand-brew coffee and Gongfu tea</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;margin-top:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#8a7f6a\">— 042 —</span><span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#8a7f6a\">▌▍▌▌▍▌▍▍ 6-2026-12</span></div>\n    </div>"]},"usageMocks":{"style-editorial-use-story":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,'Songti SC',serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#1c1812\">一块茶饼的三十年</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a7f6a;display:block;margin-top:2px\">品牌故事 · 第 12 期</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">品牌故事页：有气质的讲法</span>","style-editorial-use-long":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#1c1812\">「慢，是一种能力。」</span><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">适合深度长文与专栏内容</span>","style-editorial-use-travel":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><img src=\"/assets/style-imagery/editorial-travel-forest.webp\" style=\"width:96px;height:58px;object-fit:cover\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,'Songti SC',serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#1c1812\">去山里住一周</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">文旅、生活方式，天生适合编辑叙事</span>","style-editorial-use-annual":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1c1812\">年度特辑</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a7f6a;letter-spacing:2px\">2026</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">年报、杂志号，印刷感就是质感</span>","style-editorial-dont-tool":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:94%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:88%\"></i><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">数据后台使用杂志式排版会增加扫描负担</span></div>","style-editorial-dont-ops":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">客服工作台（首字下沉版）</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">高频操作界面应优先保证扫描与处理效率</span></div>","style-editorial-dont-cta":"<div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">购买按钮藏在第三栏末尾</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">转化型页面：CTA 不能被排版淹没</span></div>","style-editorial-dont-mobile":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:36px;height:58px;border:1.5px solid #c9c8c4;border-radius:6px\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">手机屏沿用三栏会使行宽过窄</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">小屏应改为单栏或更适合的布局</span>"}}}